256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124043#issuecomment-5927064256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124043","id":5927064256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYUfSwA","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T07:44:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T08:05:21Z","body":"> As we brought up in the core meeting yesterday, would this also benefit from `_NO_INLINE_`?\r\n> \r\n> If the objective is to prevent inlining in _all_ builds, then this should prevent LTO afaik (just googled). It appears we should at least consider `_NO_INLINE_`ing all the non-bottleneck space saving stuff.\r\n\r\nGood idea. I work on macOS where we don't use LTO so i tend to forget about it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5927064256/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5927423223","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124043#issuecomment-5927423223","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124043","id":5927423223,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYU1M9w","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T08:08:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T08:08:54Z","body":"> I work on macOS where we don't use LTO so i tend to forget about it.\r\n\r\nBTW, macOS not using LTO is just a tradeoff from apparently worse binary size numbers which made us doubt whether it's worth it. With appropriate configurations and inlining-prevention I think we could definitely start using ThinLTO on macOS too, so it would be worth evaluating gains/regressions on your PRs with ThinLTO too. Full LTO, probably not, because it's single-threaded linking and it takes ages, it's a non-starter.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5927423223/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"per